Redface 2 v0.50.2 — beta.

Big update since 0.43.0:
- Polls: vote in the app, see closed polls and their deadline, and (as topic owner) close yours from any page.
- Links: external links open without bouncing, app chooser, Firefox hint.
- Moderation posts highlighted, staff role pills.
- Forum view: remembered filter, search, separated pinned topics.
- Clickable "quoted N times" badge, plus various reading fixes.
